               </div>
               <div class="container">
                  <h2>See what's possible</h2>
                  <div class="grid-view">
                     <div class="grid-container">
                        <div class="square"><button type="button">I'm a high school student<span class="icon-circle-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div>
                        <div class="square"><button type="button">I have never been to college, or I don't have a degree yet<span class="icon-circle-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div>
                        <div class="square"><button type="button">I want to transfer to a 4-year university<span class="icon-circle-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div>
                        <div class="square"><button type="button">I want to prepare for a career or build my professional skills<span class="icon-circle-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div>
                        <div class="square"><button type="button">I'm active duty or a veteran<span class="icon-circle-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div>
