                        <div class="grid-slider">
                           <div class="grid">
                              <h3>I'm a high school student</h3>
                              <h4><a title="Information for High School Students" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/information-for/high-school-students/index.aspx">Information for High School Students<span class="icon-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></h4>
                              
                              <p>We would love to meet you! Learn more about what Southwestern can offer high school
                                 students, and get in touch with one of our counselors.</p>
                              
                              <div class="additional-links"><a title="High School Early Admissions" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/outreach/high-school-early-admissions/">High School Early Admissions<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="High School Special Program" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/information-for/high-school-students/high-school-special-program.aspx">High School Special Program<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="College Bound Dual Enrollment" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/outreach/california-college-and-career-access-pathways-ccap.aspx">College Bound Dual Enrollment<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="grid">
                              <h3>I have never been to college, or I don't have a degree yet</h3>
                              <h4><a title="Information for New Students" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/information-for/new-students/index.aspx">Information for New Students <span class="icon-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></h4>
                              
                              <p>We would love to meet you! Learn more about what Southwestern can offer new students,
                                 and get in touch with one of our counselors.</p>
                              
                              <div class="additional-links"><a title="Residency Requirements" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/residency-requirements/">Residency Requirements<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="Tuition &amp; Fees" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/tuition-and-fees/index.aspx">Tuition &amp; Fees<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="Financial Aid" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/financial-aid/index.aspx">Financial Aid<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="grid">
                              <h3>I want to transfer to a 4-year university</h3>
                              <h4><a title="Information for Transfer Students" href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/information-for/transfer-students/index.aspx">Information for Transfer Students<span class="icon-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></h4>
                              
                              <p>We would love to meet you! Learn more about what Southwestern can offer transfer students,
                                 and get in touch with one of our counselors.</p>
                              
                              <div class="additional-links"><a title="Associate Degree for Transfer" href="/student-support/transfer-connections/associate-degree-for-transfer.aspx">Associate Degree for Transfer<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="Transfer Center" href="/student-support/transfer-connections/index.aspx">Transfer Center<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="grid">
                              <h3>I want to prepare for a career or build my professional skills</h3>
                              <h4><a title="Information for Career Education Students" href="/programs-and-academics/career-education/index.aspx">Information for Career Education Students<span class="icon-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></h4>
                              
                              <p>We would love to meet you! Learn more about what Southwestern can offer career education
                                 students, and get in touch with one of our counselors.</p>
                              
                              <div class="additional-links"><a title="Online Learning" href="/locations/online-learning/index.aspx">Online Learning<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="grid">
                              <h3>I'm active duty or a veteran</h3>
                              <h4><a title="Information for Veterans" href="/student-support/veterans-services/index.aspx">Information for Veterans<span class="icon-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></h4>
                              
                              <p>We would love to meet you! Learn more about what Southwestern can offer military students,
                                 and get in touch with one of our counselors.</p>
                              
                              <div class="additional-links"><a title="Veterans' Services" href="/student-support/veterans-services/index.aspx">Veterans' Services<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="Veterans' Resource Center" href="/student-support/veterans-services/veterans-resource-center/index.aspx">Veterans' Resource Center<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="Student Veterans' Organization" href="/student-life/associated-student-organization-aso/clubs-and-organizations/veterans-student-organization.aspx">Student Veterans' Organization<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="grid">
                              <h3>I live in the SWC community</h3>
                              <h4><a title="Information for Community Members" href="/swc-community/index.aspx">Information for Community Members<span class="icon-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></h4>
                              
                              <p>Learn more about what Southwestern offers the community.</p>
                              
                              <div class="additional-links"><a title="Continuing Education" href="/programs-and-academics/continuing-education/index.aspx">Continuing Education<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="Event Calendar" href="/calendar/">Event Calendar<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a title="Jaguar Aquatics Wellness &amp; Sports" href="https://swcjaws.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jaguar Aquatics Wellness &amp; Sports<span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
                           </div>
