            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            
            <section class="home-carousel">
               <h2>&nbsp;</h2>
               <div class="carousel-slides">
                  <div class="carousel-slide">
                     <div class="carousel-image"><img xmlns:ouc="http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables" src="/_files/slider/slider_65.png" alt="65th Anniversary logo." width="700" height="467"></div>
                     <div class="carousel-text">
                        <h3>Transforming Lives &amp; Communities!</h3>
                        <p>For 65 years, Southwestern College has been a place where opportunity, community,
                           and possibility come together. Join us as we celebrate the people, milestones, and
                           memories that have shaped our college and look toward the next chapter of the Jaguar
                           legacy.</p><a href="/swc-community/65-anniversary/index.aspx" target="" class="button yellow">65th Anniversary</a></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-slide">
                     <div class="carousel-image"><img xmlns:ouc="http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables" title="" src="/_files/slider/slider_pac.jpg" alt="Performing Arts Center building" width="700" height="467"></div>
                     <div class="carousel-text">
                        <h3>New Course Numbering System!</h3>
                        <p>Heads up, Jaguars! Starting Fall 2025, some of your courses have new names and numbers
                           — but don’t worry, they are still the same great classes! Stay in the know and plan
                           ahead! More updates are coming in future semesters!</p><a href="/admissions-and-financial-aid/new-requirements-at-swc/index.aspx" target="_blank" class="button yellow">New Requirements at SWC</a></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-slide">
                     <div class="carousel-image"><img xmlns:ouc="http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables" src="/_files/slider/slider_cbe_autotech.jpg" alt="Automotive Technology stock photo of mechanic working on the engine of a car." width="700" height="467"></div>
                     <div class="carousel-text">
                        <h3>Accelerated Automotive Technology Program</h3>
                        <p>Got auto experience or want to learn at your own pace? Our CBE Accelerate Automotive
                           Technology program lets you move faster based on what you already know, with expert
                           support every step of the way.</p><a href="/programs-and-academics/competency-based-education-accelerate/index.aspx" target="_blank" class="button yellow">CBE Accelerate</a></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="carousel-slide">
                     <div class="carousel-image"><img xmlns:ouc="http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables" src="/_files/slider/slider_alum_paper_mar_edited.png" alt="Southwestern College Alumni Association logo." width="700" height="467"></div>
                     <div class="carousel-text">
                        <h3>Jaguars Unite!</h3>
                        <p>Join the SWC Alumni Association for networking opportunities, exclusive events, and
                           special discounts. Rediscover your alma mater and keep the Jaguar spirit alive!</p><a href="/swc-community/swc-foundation/alumni/index.aspx" target="_blank" class="button yellow">SWC Alumni</a></div>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </section>
            
            <section class="program-callout">
               <div class="container">
                  <h2>Learn About Our Programs &amp; Services</h2>
                  
                  <p>With 5 locations, plus several online learning options, Southwestern College provides
                     you with the best classes for your goals and schedule.</p>
                  
                  <div class="home-prog-svcs"><a class="button red" title="Programs &amp; Academics" href="/programs-and-academics/index.aspx">Programs &amp; Academics</a><a class="button red" title="Services &amp; Resources" href="/student-support/students-services-campus-resources/index.aspx">Services &amp; Resources</a></div>
               </div>
            </section>
            
            <section class="location-grid">
               <div class="container">
                  <h2>Our Locations</h2>
                  <div class="location-grid-wrapper">
                     <div class="grid-container">
